# This repo: `wwn-vms`

Machines kind **`virtual_machine`**. Not containers, not Wasm packages, not
Desktop/LockScreen, not Swinging Bridge.

## Mode A vs Mode B (design both)

| | Mode A (store) | Mode B |
|---|---|---|
| iOS / iPadOS | UTM-SE-class **jitless** interpreter | UTM/QEMU **+ JIT** (Mode B IPA only) |
| visionOS | UTM-SE-class **jitless** interpreter | UTM/QEMU **+ JIT** (Mode B IPA only) |
| macOS | Virtualization.framework paths as designed | SIP/desktop-host privileges as designed |
| Android | Play-safe engine | Root/privileged outside Play |

- **Never** link JIT Mode B into App Store / Play artifacts.
- tvOS / watchOS: VM kinds **forbidden** (policy).
- Per-OS backends differ — do not force one QEMU/UTM stack onto every host.
- Leave active Apple Container work in `wwn-containers` alone unless asked.

